# Quality tools

This repo is a Silverstripe 5 installer sandbox. Day-to-day quality gates are PHPUnit, PHPStan (Silverstan), and PHPCS (PSR-12). There is no Behat job yet.

## Setup

From the repo root:

```sh
ddev start
ddev composer install
```

## Commands (DDEV)

Prefer DDEV wrappers. They call the Composer scripts of the same name.

| Gate | Command |
|------|---------|
| PHPUnit (`app/tests` only) | `ddev test` |
| PHPStan (level 9, `app/src` and `app/tests`) | `ddev phpstan` |
| PHPCS (PSR-12, `app`) | `ddev phpcs` |
| PHPStan, PHPCS, then PHPUnit | `ddev check` |

Composer equivalents: `ddev composer test`, `ddev composer phpstan`, `ddev composer phpcs`, `ddev composer lint` (alias of phpcs), `ddev composer check`.

## CI

GitHub Actions is `.github/workflows/ci.yml`. It uses `silverstripe/gha-ci` with one PHP 8.3 + MySQL 8.0 job: PHPUnit and PHP lint (phpcs then phpstan). End-to-end, JS, and doclint jobs are off.

Do not add a PHPStan baseline file. Fix `app/` instead.

Installer `Page` and `PageController` stay in the global namespace. Other new PHP should use a real namespace (e.g. `App\`).
